SUMMARY:Gardening/Culinary Workshop for Adults
DESCRIPTION:Come and join us for a culinary delight.  We'll discuss the 
 benefits of gardening.  Create delicious\, all natural\, healthy dips using 
 vegetables from your garden.  These recipes require 5 ingredients or less. 
 They're quick and easy to make and enjoy as an appetizer for parties\, 
 holiday spreads\, picnics or just to impress family and friends.  You'll be 
 able to watch how to make 3 different veggie dips\, and receive a copy of 
 the recipes.\n\nMary's Bio:\n\nMary Silvestri\, MA\, is a multifaceted 
 educator.  She's traveled around the world and is passionate about 
 cooking\, gardening and being out in nature.  She loves creating new 
 recipes and sharing them with others.  She was the owner of a pesto company 
 she created by growing basil in her own backyard and also produced and 
 hosted a local cable cooking show.\n\n
